 "what_this_shows": [
  "Attempt 1: the lead searched the logs itself instead of delegating. Its request grew past the enforced per-request size ceiling and the gateway refused to send it. The run ended incomplete with no findings.",
  "Attempts 2 to 4: the lead planned first, delegated the checks to the auditor, wrote a case file and read it back before attribution, and consulted the skeptic. They established 5, 3 and 4 of the 5 executed effects; every accepted allegation matched an executed effect, and no person was named.",
